  "body": "## Changes\r\n\r\n* feat: add `--lines` flag to `dprint fmt` for range formatting (#1329)\r\n* feat: check for newer remote configuration files and add `--reload[=config|plugins]` flag (#1328)\r\n* feat: support npm specifiers in `extends` (#1332)\r\n* feat: add riscv64gc-unknown-linux-musl builds (#1323)\r\n* feat: add s390x-unknown-linux-gnu builds (#1324)\r\n* feat: add FreeBSD x86_64 and aarch64 builds (#1325)\r\n* perf: compile wasm plugin functions in parallel (#1315)\r\n* perf: load cached wasm plugins in parallel (#1316)\r\n* perf: wake the fs lock keep-alive thread immediately on release (#1317)\r\n* perf: memory map cached wasm plugins on unix (#1318)\r\n* perf: read the .npmrc files once per config dir instead of per npm plugin (#1320)\r\n* fix: format explicit paths outside the `--config` file's directory with only its unanchored patterns (#1314)\r\n* fix: accept npm: specifiers in the `--plugins` CLI flag (#1319)\r\n* fix: kill process plugin subprocesses so shutdown cannot hang (#1311)\r\n* fix: improve generated shell completions (#1331)\r\n* fix: detect the plugin file a package ships when updating an npm plugin (#1334)\r\n* fix: warn when using old dprint-plugin-gofumpt versions (#1310)\r\n\r\n## Install\r\n\r\nRun `dprint upgrade` or see https://dprint.dev/install/\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n\r\nThese artifacts have [build provenance attestations](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/security-for-github-actions/using-artifact-attestations/using-artifact-attestations-to-establish-provenance-for-builds).\r\nVerify a download with the [GitHub CLI](https://cli.github.com/):\r\n\r\n```shell\r\ngh attestation verify dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip --repo dprint/dprint\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Checksums\r\n\r\n|Artifact|SHA-256 Checksum|\r\n|:--|:--|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-apple-darwin.zip|3cf624098a1d49b978b4e87355f087fe4bf8426ea1e1e6ff9b2859138a41eea0|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-apple-darwin.zip|b0d4b4c9c2ea68f86caa044f139b898d2cd0c4080cdc8bf70be9454a8acfe0af|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|322e47e188bba6ff3784ef1be0c5f569fc270467eeac4dd10015030599d9466d|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc-installer.exe|3cc11dd917e52a77e4771e5539c3c53707029faa945778a489cc4f00047cc1d6|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-pc-windows-msvc.zip|39c70a48172840d7b40f1133ff4f944b2b5775e5b58cecd170fdcd43884ac415|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|9d2de0313bbfc26ed80148a38a430c037a216a905cdf317f6271f8a10311933a|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|e8d4a78fc6aa1b1a3f007d947a3c9a1ae1b0c240868107c496eb2992cc1630be|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|79025432b0fcfaa09fa1324a97a2cf4ec5d972175830fb496dc4be4f6a89340e|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|c423c7ee51187129db67f0bab4584cf7ff6fdeb29faf04d1521fa79a5c12c520|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|20bc8c48affd664cef4bdf1123bf4aa4dfff419ee692b3ec52b94d89a7a84096|\r\n|dprint-riscv64gc-unknown-linux-musl.zip|ef9e8a5cccedfc9d2e5c077cec1a65a3da0989d7019f1f56b62520bf6ef81fc3|\r\n|dprint-s390x-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|dab1e69ac6398cf39fec9511337321dea14ff25d3bdcdf85e35d60a267b6f277|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|8e84daaa12f331cceb51bcf45965c4a012ad038b780ccaff5f99b58c131f30e0|\r\n|dprint-loongarch64-unknown-linux-musl.zip|0dc2f45f9ab2de05f55fad978bda72e2f4b6befda7ada60f52998a0ba002ecbd|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu.zip|bbb1e4430d0f9bf7613dfdd979c415f835053b6240453112f97260e0f4592b08|\r\n|dprint-powerpc64le-unknown-linux-musl.zip|eb43af95467f0f955392c5cc390deaf2f85e5b172150f3ca13ed91ff8769a940|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-linux-android.zip|7afdf81eeb9adfff6e0ba49d7c53fb8bb5abde7fabdd8e37021fb774485c5ade|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-linux-android.zip|103783549df6a052be70b68567c210b95aee7f55366e680053c5b3249c1c23ea|\r\n|dprint-x86_64-unknown-freebsd.zip|f56a4b605885b26dd6625d6bf6f3f67868e393ab553f1d4097683e7a1375ce77|\r\n|dprint-aarch64-unknown-freebsd.zip|caec9fb7b04e0dc4d0be6c294ab6eb52c2d2d7e6652a9f8088a09ea4b0a874ee|\r\n"
